# Marca do CodeOS no instalador (Calamares)
---
componentName: codeos
welcomeStyleCalamares: false
welcomeExpandingLogo: false
windowExpanding: normal
windowSize: 960px,640px
windowPlacement: center
sidebar: widget
navigation: widget

strings:
    productName:         CodeOS
    shortProductName:    CodeOS
    version:             1.0
    shortVersion:        1.0
    versionedName:       CodeOS 1.0
    shortVersionedName:  CodeOS 1.0
